WEBVTT

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.820
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.220
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.140
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.360
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.200
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.540
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.760
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.850
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:27.810
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:50.580
THE HERO'S TUTOR

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.850
Dark Army, advance!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.350
Charge! Charge!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.290
This looks very grim. Speed it up, Popp.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.750
Yes, Master.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.460
Woo-hoo! Go, go!

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.260
What's wrong with you?!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.680
Are you okay, Gomechan?

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.350
What's wrong with everyone?!

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.690
Grampa, emergency!

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:05.080
Get a grip, Grampa!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:08.830
Dai?

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.120
Grampa!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:12.880
Are you okay?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:17.210
It feels like black blood
is coursing through my veins!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.720
If I don't stay focused,
I think I'll go berserk!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:26.430
Everyone suddenly became violent.
What's wrong with them?

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:32.770
There's only one possible reason.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.270
The Dark Lord has returned!

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:36.360
What?!

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:41.950
<i>This urge to go berserk
can only be the Dark Lord's evil will.</i>

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:47.280
<i>He wants to gather us with his dark power
to try to overthrow the world again!</i>

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.120
No way...

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:55.040
Dai, you must leave this island!
Otherwise we might kill you!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.590
Hurry!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.380
But...

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:05.550
It was my good heart that let me raise you
after you drifted here on this boat.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:10.020
At this rate, I might harm you
with my own hands.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.890
Grampa...

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:18.860
Just go!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:19.820
No!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.780
Listen to me!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:26.070
I can't run by myself!
That's not what a Hero would do!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.030
Dai...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.490
Precisely!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.080
Well said. You must be...

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:33.370
Dai.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.580
How do you know my name?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:43.630
Why don't you leave this to me.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.020
Look out!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.440
Don't worry. Master's got this.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.230
Master?

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:22.210
Dark influence, begone!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.890
Glimmer!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.910
Oh wow.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.120
It's a miracle.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.330
Who are you?

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.500
How rude of me. I...

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:01.460
I CAN TRAIN YOUR HERO!!
A 15-YEAR VETERAN OF THE TRADE

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:01.460
am a Hero trainer.
Basically a tutor for Heroes.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.460
A Hero's tutor?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:09.510
Yes. Agents of peace who uphold justice
and defeat evil! Heroes, Sages, Mages...

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.640
It is my job to train them
into first-class warriors!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:18.350
It is I, Avan De Zinuar III.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.650
Where have I heard that name?

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.070
And this is my student, Popp.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:28.490
He is currently training to become a Mage.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.320
So why is such a tutor here?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:37.330
Perhaps you've noticed
that the Dark Lord has returned.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.620
I knew it.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.420
Monsters under his control are everywhere,

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.210
and people in places
like Romos and Papnica are in danger.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:48.920
No! King Romos and Leona, too?!

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:53.300
The Papnica royal family
asked that I come here.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:58.980
They want me to train the future Hero
on Dermline Island to be a true Hero.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.230
Dai, will you undergo my training?

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:08.940
This is to defeat the Dark Lord,
so it will be exceptionally hard.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:13.200
I'll do it! If Leona is in danger,
I have to go help her!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:17.370
Plus, if we don't defeat the Dark Lord,
Grampa and the others can't live in peace!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:23.000
Please train me! I'll become a true Hero
and defeat the Dark Lord!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.380
Very good!

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.010
What's that?!

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.550
Gargoyles!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.510
I see humans!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.100
Kill them!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.350
What the hell?!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:41.980
Check it out!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:46.360
A magic circle of light
has sealed off the entire island!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.610
They appear to be
scouts for the Dark Lord.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.570
Popp, take care of them.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.370
Huh?! By myself?!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:08:00.080
I used the purification spell, Glimmer,
so I am very, very tired.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.830
Aww. No fair, Master.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.380
Don't push!
I get it already!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.050
Hey! I'll fight you!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.880
You brat!

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.590
Don't make me laugh!

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.010
Kafrizz!

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:24.190
<i>He trained that boy to be
such a powerful magic user!</i>

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.520
<i>It seems this man is the real deal.</i>

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:28.900
You bastard!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:32.190
I'll roast you into fried chicken next!

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:33.950
Fizzle!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.490
Ka... Ka...

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.330
Take that, brat!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.000
Oh... Oh crap!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.000
How disappointing.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:49.750
I told you that Gargoyles can use
the magic impairment spell, Fizzle.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.130
What the hell?!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.180
Servant of the Dark Lord...

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.060
get off of this island!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.520
Darn it!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.280
Look out!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.710
You may use that.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.710
It's a distinguished legendary sword.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:50.190
It'll take more than improvised swordplay
to defeat a soldier of the Dark Army!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.980
Don't get cocky!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.880
I did it!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:14.300
You did it!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:17.470
That's really an amazing sword, Master!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:22.430
<i>Hmm. It's actually a cheap sword
I bought at a used goods store.</i>

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:26.680
<i>It seems this boy may be quite the find.</i>

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.440
Master, what's my next training?!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.900
Now, now. Don't get ahead of yourself, Dai

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:38.990
Popp, you're the older student,
so look after Dai.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.070
Nice to meet you, Mr. Popp.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.080
It's just Popp.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:49.580
Now then, I have various training courses,
but we're short on time.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:56.420
And so, Dai, you will be taking the
one week hero-making Special Hard Course.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:00.590
What?! I can become a Hero in a week?!

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:04.560
There's no way you can!
Don't do it! You'll die!

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.350
Popp...

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.350
You can join, too.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.690
No thank you, Master!
I'm fine with the normal training!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.070
I'll do it!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:19.780
I need to get strong and save Leona
as soon as possible!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:24.160
Very good.
We'll begin your hard training tomorrow.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.330
Huh? Not right away?

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:29.410
Sir Avan is tired from a long journey.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:33.580
He's also expended much Magic Power
casting such a powerful spell.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:38.340
Precisely.
Let's all get some proper rest today.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.260
I understand!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.800
There's no way you could
become a Hero in just a week.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.560
KASWOOSH
VORTEX-TYPE SPELL

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.560
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:08.080
Right. The Special Hard Course.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:33.140
Dai, slice this with a sword.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.060
Huh?! This?!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.480
This is the first day's objective.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:47.120
Oh no! I broke the legendary sword!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.530
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:52.290
Don't worry about it.
Use your knife instead.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.000
Okay!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.920
<i>This sword only cost ten gold coins,
so it's only natural.</i>

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.390
It's no good. I can't cut it.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.810
I guess you're not ready yet.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:14.730
In that case, go run a little more.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:25.860
Now we'll begin
the normal training course!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.240
Hey, are you okay?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.040
First is Avan Style Basic Training!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.500
Next is Avan Style Unarmed Combat!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:45.470
Don't forget the basics of magic!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:48.590
Popp, what sort of training is this?

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:52.640
It's meditation
to increase your Magic Power.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.020
Now for magic practice.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.230
Crackle!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.780
The wave froze! Amazing!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:15.950
Of course, I've been training
with Master for over a year.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:23.630
Huh?!

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.470
You fail to see things through as usual.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:31.260
Magic is about focus. Focus.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.220
Yes sir.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.470
Now Dai, it's your turn.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.190
Crack!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.610
Not much potential for magic, I see.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.700
I don't have to worry
about him overtaking me.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.410
Hard training! Sword practice!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:04.630
<i>Very good.
He does show promise in swordplay.</i>

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.840
Don't worry.
That man possesses unfathomable skill.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:15.760
Besides, I've never
seen Dai train so seriously.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.310
Now Dai.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.610
Let's give it another go.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.200
Master, I'm completely beat.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.990
Just trust me and give it a try.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.200
Okay.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.340
I cut it?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:56.810
When people are thoroughly exhausted,
their movements become simple.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:01.020
In other words,
their most natural movements.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.060
You tended to move too much
with your sword.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:08.980
You've always had the strength
to slice a boulder like this.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:13.490
Master, you really are amazing!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.580
<i>He really sliced it in one day!</i>

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.620
Well done, Dai!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.710
He really must have been exhausted.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:37.010
Master, are you really going to continue
with the Special Hard Course?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:44.560
Of course. His grand objective
is to save his friends, so he'll be fine.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:52.280
Popp, you can join us with the morning
and evening training if you'd like.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:27.770
<i>Well done. You made me use
both hands in only two days.</i>

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.530
Dai, you amaze me.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:41.540
To improve this much since yesterday
is astounding progress.

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:45.370
As a reward, let me show you
my special move.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.250
Huh?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:54.130
This is my super special attack.
Try to master it as soon as possible.

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.140
Master, are you...

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.600
Avan Strash!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:07.190
Master just went and showed him
his best attack!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:10.940
It's this strong with just a wooden stick?
That's an amazing attack!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:15.940
Popp, you can join
the Special Hard Course anytime.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:19.370
Huh?! No thanks!
I'm fine with the Normal Course!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.330
AVAN STYLE SWORD TECHNIQUE THEORY
EARTH, SEA, AIR

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.330
The theory
of the Avan Style Sword Technique.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:29.330
Earth, sea, and air. You will learn
to slice these three things.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.590
Earth? Sea and air?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.970
Yes. Let's start with
the earth slicing attack, Earth Slash.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.720
The key to this attack is power.
In other words, strength.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.070
Avan Style Sword Technique!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.610
Earth Slash!

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:11.330
Very nice.
You've almost mastered Earth Slash.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:17.510
But Earth Slash is the most basic attack.
I wanna learn Avan Strash.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.760
No, no. Everything has its proper order.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:25.180
AVAN STYLE SWORD TECHNIQUE THEORY
EARTH, SEA, AIR

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.180
<i>Slice the earth, slice the sea,
slice the air.</i>

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.890
And what slices everything is Avan Strash.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:32.600
Oh. I've got a long way to go.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.280
Popp.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.990
If you're watching, tend to Dai.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:41.990
Y-Yes sir!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.120
There. Get some rest until dinner.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.750
Thanks.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.170
Are you really going
to continue this all week?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.830
Yeah. I am.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:58.380
That's insane. Do you really like
that Papnica Princess that much?

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:00.670
Pretty much.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.720
You're so naive.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:17.400
I do apologize for dinner being so late.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.730
N-Not at all.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:23.490
I get so excited watching Dai's progress
I get caught up in the training.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.530
And Popp too.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:26.740
Popp?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:32.290
Oh, he would never
take his training seriously.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.500
Every time I gave him a hard task,
he'd always give up.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:40.170
But recently, he's been curious about Dai
and keeps spying on him.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.420
I see.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:46.010
By the way, tomorrow's training
could get a little chaotic.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.220
Is there a place we can use
where we won't trouble others?

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.890
A place that won't cause trouble?

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:57.020
You managed to learn Earth Slash
in two days, Dai.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:02.780
Therefore, your third day training
shall be to learn an even harder skill.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:03.530
Yes sir.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.120
It won't be easy.
If you aren't careful...

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:07.370
you will die.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:11.950
What sort of training is it?

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:15.370
Very simple. You will fight me.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.630
That's all?

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:23.470
However, I will be using a special spell,
so you may use your knife.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.880
My knife of Papnica?

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:30.510
That's right. My skin will
be harder than steel after all.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:36.650
Here we go, Dai.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:43.280
Puff!

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:55.830
Master turned into a Dragon!

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:35.680
<i>To learn the Avan Style Sword Technique</i>

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:41.190
<i>Dai bravely faces Avan, who changed
into a Dragon using an ancient spell.</i>

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:45.980
<i>Through Avan's training,
Dai rapidly grows stronger.</i>

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:50.900
<i>But an evil presence closes in.</i>

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.910
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:57.290
<i>"The Dark Lord Hadlar's Return"</i>

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.620
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
